      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Alright, I've got it. Putting it all together, it fits best with tonsillitis, probably bacterial. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. It could also be a viral throat infection, so we'll keep that open. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a very sore throat, severe, and no difficulty breathing or rash.",
